              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu nzu nini y’umutunzi ntihabamw’ imbombovu z’ivyacuzwe mw izahabu no mw ifeza gusa, ariko habamwo n’iz’ ivy’ ibiti n’iz’ ivy’ ibumba, kandi bimwe babikoresha ivy’ icubahiro, ibindi babikoresha ibiteye isoni. ",
